    check "sample_gradients' two fills: a linear gradient at 90 degrees and a path gradient at 0.5 on each side, each of two stops at 0 and 1: every number in the writer's range, the positions in order, two stops (change ND55)" "$(yn reach_has "$TG_NUMS" "$B/grad.out")"
